      "side": 1,
      "message": "AIUI the previous behavior causes a problem when the snapshot is used in a build where linux_bionic_arm64 is configured. However, I am a little unclear on what exactly that problem is and how this change helps. After all without a linux_bionic_arm64 variant in the snapshot you won\u0027t be able to build for linux_bionic_arm64.\n\nSo, what build error do we get with the previous behavior? What behavior do we get with this change?",
      "revId": "016c20fedc7bbac40d6aee809961c20bf29c6d6d",
